senses.gloss:
√vraj (vrájati; vavrā́ja; ávrājīt; vrajiṣyáti;
vrajitá; vrájitum; vrajitvā́;
-vrájya). march, proceed, go.
+ ā, come hither, go unto.
+ praty-ā, march or go back.
+ pari, march round about; wander
around.
+ pra, march forth; go unto; wander;
esp. leave one's house to wander about as
an ascetic, 65^2.
